      "content": "it’s just hard to explain. it’s like everyone moved on to the next thing, the next person, the next trend, and i’m just stuck here. i look at old posts or photos and i don't even recognize that person. they were bright and they had a purpose. this version of me? there's no purpose. there's literally nothing left to contribute. it feels like i'm just performing a role in a movie that ended a long time ago.",
      "source": "evaluator"
